* SPICE Netlist

* Voltage Source
V1 6 0 V_s

* Resistor
R1 6 4 R_S

* Voltage-Controlled Current Source
G1 2 7 4 0 g_m

* Resistor
R2 4 5 r_o

* Current-Controlled Voltage Source
F1 2 0 V2 g_mb

* Resistor
R3 2 3 R_L

* Nodes:
* 0 - Ground
* 2 - Common node
* 3 - V_o
* 4 - Intermediate node
* 5 - Node for r_o
* 6 - V_s+
* 7 - Node for current-controlled source